  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88f6fa2b89436164b8e97b17d82dc9a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3 - Purple Essence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_purple_essence
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Purple Essence
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Purple Essence</b>


    Purple Essence is a strange underground
    substance commonly found within Purple Veins.


    To collect it, you must first
    use drill() on the Purple Vein to expose the essence beneath the surface.


    After
    the essence has been exposed, use pump() to extract it for collection.


    Because
    Purple Essence remains underground before extraction, you may safely pass over
    a Purple Vein without interacting with it if you do not wish to collect it.'
  isImageBig: 0
